{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18418","headline":"西蜀送许中庸归秦赴举 · 陈羽","name":"西蜀送许中庸归秦赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春色华阳国，秦人此别离。\n驿楼横水影，乡路入花枝。\n日暖莺飞好，山晴马去迟。\n劒门当石隘，栈阁入云危。\n独鹤心千里，贫交酒一巵。\n桂条攀偃蹇，兰叶藉参差。\n旅梦惊蝴蝶，残芳怨子规。\n碧霄今夜月，惆怅上峨嵋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈羽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}